{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仮面女子のメンバーの方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後のこと言ってくれてて嬉しい川後です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あの番組でみうちゃんが乃木坂と共演したいと言ったときは凄いびっくりしたし、嬉しかったなあ。あと、小柳さんは同じ長崎出身だから勝手に親近感、、長崎トークしたい、、。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のブログ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真面目でウザめでめんどくさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なっがーくダラダラとかいた文なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の「ばいぴょん」って文まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワープして結構です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかそれ推薦する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"または一週間使って読むべし！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル22公演を終えました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が「レッツゴーっ!ポリン姫」の10役で出来たのはクリスティーヌ・エルザ・エステルでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見よ、わたしのやりたかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エステル(兼・警備員)の顔面を。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛らしいだろ( ｡-ω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生意気そうだろ( ｡-ω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(貴方)<顔面濃いな。  ←おい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来た数は少ないけれど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に好きな役だった3つを演じることができて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり入れないことが多くって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は凄い悔しい日がずっとで。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(その分、役をもらった日は嬉しかったです。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3幕でミニライブをするときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなめろさんの顔を見たらますます申し訳なくって。でも、ひなめろさんが応援してくれてるのみたら明日も頑張ろうって思えて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな日々でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はあまり感情が伝わんなんないといわれるんで自分の思ったこと詳しく話します。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これは真面目に書くね✌︎✌︎✌︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1幕のコントでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アドリブで毒舌を加えたりしたらいいじゃん。」など色んな人にアドバイスして頂いたんだけど、それが私には、台本からどれだけはみだしていいのか分からなくって。普段はアニメ・アイドル番組"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばかり見ているけど封印して期間中は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お笑いの動画とか見まくりました。悩みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル中盤から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モノマネの風潮があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとその風潮があるのなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"適応した方が賢い考えだし良かったのかもしれなかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ今回は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バラエティなど番組で活かせる笑いを見つけたり演技の中の面白さを見つけるのが自分自身での最初に掲げた「自己プロデュース」という一つの目標だったので舞台を通して勉強しようと思ってしませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(プリンシパルの目標は人それぞれだし、決まりは無いのでこれは私なりの個人的考えです。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局この考え方で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまく自分を出そうと思っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出せていなかったのは事実です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方の前では「ひなぴょん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画面を通すと「川後P」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になってしまう面が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の課題だと感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(分かる人には意味がわかる筈)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひなぴょん」で好きになった人も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「川後P」で好きになった人もいてくれるだろうから難しいです...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、その二つをうまく自己プロデュースできるようになれたらと。そこが課題ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はプリンシパルの舞台であまり「自己プロデュース」を発揮できなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏では「自己プロデュース」しとこうと思って普段よりブログとかモバメとか送りまくってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパム並みの日もあったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現実逃避(?)してんじゃ無いか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思った方がいたらすみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは、違います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諦めたりとかはなかったです。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切り替えてやってました。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このプリンシパルの経験が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かの為になったと信じて、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は正直、自分では成長を感じません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、それを実感するときがいつか来ると信じて。時間がかかってもこの経験を活かせるときが来ますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己プロデュースに繋げていけたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スゲーｳｵｵｵｵｱｱｱｱ\\( 'ω')/ｱｱｱｱｱｯｯｯｯ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか「スゲー！意味あったわ！」ってなるように頑張ろうｳｵｵｵｵｱｱｱｱ\\( 'ω')/ｱｱｱｱｱｯｯｯｯ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長にも欠点にもいつかは気づける人間になれたら素晴らしいｳｵｵｵｵｱｱｱｱ\\( 'ω')/ｱｱｱｱｱｯｯｯｯ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の魅力とか見つけれたら素晴らしいｳｵｵｵｵｱｱｱｱ\\( 'ω')/ｱｱｱｱｱｯｯｯｯ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、だめだ、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ真面目に書けないｳｵｵｵｵｱｱｱｱ\\( 'ω')/ｱｱｱｱｱｯｯｯｯ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(根は真面目なのバレたかな？なんてね、笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援して下さった皆さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に来て下さったみなさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票して下さった皆さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれた皆さんありがとうございました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーをみてて感じたこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは途中から何かを掴んでるのがみえて、ひめたんはひめたんでいいんだよっていうのが見えた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビームで草も狩れるとか最高。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ちゃんやまいやん、かずみんとかはやっぱり凄い。改めてそう感じた。本当に流石。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"研究生かりんちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無遅刻無欠席で誰よりも早くきて練習してて、私たちより出れる回数が少ないけれど、それでも一生懸命な姿とか楽しんでる姿が素晴らしくって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の尊敬する人のひとり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄いなとおもう面が全員一人一人ありすぎて全員はここにはあげれないけど本当に色んな面がみえたプリンシパル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのエピソード・秘話は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメで語る人だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここではあまり言わない←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしいもん。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてったって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり書くと良い人オーラ出ちゃうからね三┗( ^o^)┛三┏( ^o^)┓(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーやっぱり真面目な話は難しいゼｳｵｵｵｵｱｱｱｱ\\( 'ω')/ｱｱｱｱｱｯｯｯｯ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパを終えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"活動をいったん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学業の為お休みする生ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりさみしい。次のシングルにいないのが不思議ってくらいに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さみしいけど、ちゃんと戻ってくるから早く戻ってこれるのを待つしかだね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲネのときにこっそりおさめておいた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ちゃんポリン(｡*´꒳`*｡)♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛かったなー。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お嬢様感が流石、似合います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだゲネのときのメンバーの写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるけどそれはモバメで流す(｡•ㅅ•｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか今ね一眼デジ持ち歩くんハマってるからみんなの写真いっぱい送るというか送ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秘話とかもいろいろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル中に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの推しメン様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が来てくださっていた！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっほーさんー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喋りはじめる瞬間に何故か手をとって握手しながら「大好きです」っていっちゃったー絶対引かれることやっちゃたよーなのに神対応いただいた(;_;)♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことにご飯行く約束したの(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達への一歩とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手に思っちゃってるよ✧٩( 'ω' )و ✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いは正義。ほんとそれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも沢山の方が観にきてくださって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたい！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地味に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログに5時間以上かかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/06/19/0673697/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"htt